---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /admin/avis/index.html
title: "Modération des avis"
description: "Back-office MaisonCBDVape"
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{% set adminSection = "avis" %}
<section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 lg:py-14">

  {% include "partials/admin-nav.njk" %}

  <div class="mb-8">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs text-smoke uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Back-office</p>
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-white tracking-wide">AVIS</h1>
    <p class="text-smoke text-sm mt-3 max-w-2xl">
      Rien n'est visible sur le site avant votre validation. Chaque avis vient d'une
      commande retrouvée, passée par l'adresse qui l'a écrit — c'est ce qui rend la
      mention « achat vérifié » exacte.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div id="avis-status" class="rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-dark-border bg-dark-card/40 py-20 text-center">
    <p class="text-smoke text-sm">Chargement…</p>
  </div>

  <div id="avis-panel" class="hidden">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-5 flex-wrap">
      <button data-etat="attente" class="filter-pill is-active px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">À valider</button>
      <button data-etat="publie"  class="filter-pill px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">Publiés</button>
      <button data-etat="refuse"  class="filter-pill px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">Refusés</button>
    </div>
    <div id="avis-liste" class="space-y-3"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<script src="/assets/js/admin-avis.js" defer></script>
